{
	"id": "idrotf",
	"name": "idrotf",
	"title": "Icewind Dale: Rime of the Frostmaiden",
	"description": "<p><strong>Icewind Dale: Rime of the Frostmaiden equips Dungeon Masters with everything you need to run an adventure for characters level 1 to 12.</strong></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Buy </span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Icewind Dale: Rime of the Frostmaiden</span></i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to start playing a chilling horror adventure</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Beneath the unyielding night sky, you stand before a towering glacier and recite an ancient rhyme, causing a crack to form in the great wall of ice. Beyond this yawning fissure, the Caves of Hunger await. </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">What fantastic secrets and treasures are entombed in the sunless heart of the glacier, and what will their discovery mean for the denizens of Icewind Dale?</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&bull; <strong>26 unique locations</strong> around Ten Towns filled with quests to guide new characters&nbsp;<br /></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&bull;&nbsp;<strong>80&nbsp;new bone-chilling monsters</strong> to use in the Encounter Builder to create &amp; run battles<br /></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&bull;&nbsp;<strong>Rollable tables</strong>, <strong>detailed maps</strong>, and <strong>new NPCs</strong> to help dungeon masters run this <strong>320-page frigid adventure</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Explore the world around Icewind Dale with these adventures:<br /></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">-&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #3366ff;\"><a style=\"color: #3366ff;\" href=\"https://www.dndbeyond.com/marketplace/sourcebooks/tashas-cauldron-of-everything?icid_medium=crosspromo\" target=\"_blank\">Tasha's Cauldron of Everything</a><strong><a href=\"https://www.dndbeyond.com/marketplace/sourcebooks/players-handbook?icid_source=dmgmp&amp;icid_medium=crosspromo\" target=\"_blank\"><br /></a></strong></span></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">-<span style=\"color: #3366ff;\"><a style=\"color: #3366ff;\" href=\"https://www.dndbeyond.com/marketplace/sourcebooks/sword-coast-adventurers-guide?icid_source=IWDMP&amp;icid_medium=crosspromo&amp;icid_campaign=scag\"> Sword Coast Adventure Guide</a></span></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">-&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #3366ff;\"><a style=\"color: #3366ff;\" href=\"https://www.dndbeyond.com/marketplace/adventures/baldurs-gate-descent-into-avernus?icid_source=IWDMP&amp;icid_medium=crosspromo&amp;icid_campaign=bgdia\">Baldur&rsquo;s Gate: Descent into Avernus</a></span></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">-<span style=\"color: #3366ff;\"> <a style=\"color: #3366ff;\" href=\"https://www.dndbeyond.com/marketplace/adventures/waterdeep-dragon-heist?icid_source=IWDMP&amp;icid_medium=crosspromo&amp;icid_campaign=wdh\">Waterdeep: Dragon Heist</a></span></span></p>\r\n<hr />\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This purchase unlocks the contents of this adventure for use with D&amp;D Beyond, including the book in digital format in the game compendium&nbsp;and access options from the book in the searchable listings, </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">encounter builder</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, character builder, and digital sheet</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br /></span></p>",
